{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1114642-is-forged-by-dragon-s-fire-compatible-with-m20","id":1114642,"title":"Is forged by Dragon's Fire compatible with M20?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-11T09:42:05-07:00","id":1114642,"title":"Is forged by Dragon's Fire compatible with M20?","content":"Is it fully compatible with M20 or should I modify it. Or should I just not use it?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T11:49:16-07:00","id":1114693,"title":"","content":"In a word, no. The sphere of Prime was the most revised of the spheres in M20.<br /> <br /> Book of secrets apparently has an updated guide to wonders, but I can't confirm that yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T11:58:21-07:00","id":1114695,"title":"","content":"Book of Secrets does update pretty much everything from FbDF's regarding Wonders... and it didn't really end up that dissimilar in the end. Things like expanded Familiar creation haven't been addressed yet, but there isn't much reason you couldn't use that part with M20 with a few tweaks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T14:06:24-07:00","id":1114742,"title":"","content":"You might need to modify it. Hopefully Book of Secrets handles it, because M20 made some oblique references to things that didn't make sense without some context from Forged by Dragon's Fire. The note above on Prime being different for thresholds at crafting the various types of items is important to keep in mind.<br /> <br /> Until Book of Secrets is out (hoepfully soon!), I think you can carefully adjust Forged by Dragon's Fire into M20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12988-imperator","name":"Imperator","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-12T06:16:11-07:00","id":1115059,"title":"","content":"IMHO I find the Book of Secrets to explain Wonders (and their creation) simpeler and better than anything before it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/987-tuch","name":"Tuch"